      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure how many non-chromium repos are using depot_tools to format Java, but if they do, they would use the binary set in `ENV[\"GOOGLE_JAVA_FORMAT_PATH\"]`.\n\nMaybe, could we consider providing \"--noaosp\" in `git cl format`, so that they use it? They\u0027d probably need to change their PRESUBMIT.py to pass the param as well (for format validation)\n\nEven if there are a small number of non-chromium repos using depot_tools, maybe we should provide a way to enable `--aosp`. However, with the highlighted code section, non-chromium repos have no way to enable it in `depot_tools`.",
